<mxCell id="note_0" value="Browser = ShopCouponsPage + couponService + Axios. Account holder may have any role; the expanded successful request is SHOP_MANAGER. A denied request stops immediately: later messages belong only to the permitted path. Errors return through NestJS exception handling; no controller call occurs after guard rejection." style="text;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="2595" width="3360" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note_1" value="NestJS pipeline is a framework participant. JWT self-messages summarize Passport + JwtStrategy + Prisma delegation. Invalid/missing/expired JWT or absent/inactive/deleted User: 401 before RolesGuard. Passport sets request.user from the reloaded User; its database role governs access." style="text;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="2645" width="3360" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note_2" value="@Roles stores metadata under ROLES_KEY = roles. Reflector reads handler first, then controller. Missing metadata or an empty role array returns true immediately; RolesGuard alone does not authenticate. Non-empty roles plus missing request.user or role mismatch: 403. No role hierarchy or automatic Admin bypass exists." style="text;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="2700" width="3360" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note_3" value="Actual coupon RBAC examples: Admin createPlatformCoupon = SYSTEM_ADMIN or SYSTEM_MANAGER; Shop createStoreCoupon / approveCoupon = SHOP_MANAGER; KOL proposeCoupon = COLLABORATOR. Store controller metadata also allows Admin/Manager for inherited methods, but approveCoupon overrides that list to SHOP_MANAGER only." style="text;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="2755" width="3360" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note_4" value="Controller delegates to CouponsService (see FR12): recheck SHOP_MANAGER; require Store.ownerId = userId; apply approval policy and writes. Another Shop owner gets 403; missing Store gets 404. Service internals are omitted. RolesGuard itself performs no DB query, ownership check or KYC check." style="text;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="2810" width="3360" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note_5" value="Selected protected route only: guards are bound explicitly by @UseGuards, not a universal application-wide policy. FR9 uses its own StoreOwnerGuard. Frontend RoleGuard controls workspace navigation; backend guards enforce API access independently. Library base classes and DTO/pipes/interceptor internals are omitted." style="text;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="2865" width="3360" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>